sequenceDiagram
    actor Maya
    participant Runtime as CMP-003 Runtime
    participant Budget as INT-026 Budget Manager
    participant Agent as AGT-001 / INT-022
    participant Gateway as CMP-005 Gateway
    participant Tool as TOOL-004 Draft Case
    participant Reconcile as INT-030 Reconciler
    participant Checkpoint as INT-029 Checkpoint Store

    Maya->>Runtime: Run goal with trusted principal and budgets
    Runtime->>Budget: Check time/model/iteration budget
    Runtime->>Agent: Request one structured decision
    Agent-->>Runtime: call TOOL-004 + usage
    Runtime->>Budget: Settle model tokens/cost
    Runtime->>Gateway: Invoke with application idempotency key
    Gateway->>Tool: Create draft
    Tool-->>Gateway: Timeout after dispatch (commit unknown)
    Gateway-->>Runtime: DATA-047 ambiguous_write
    Runtime->>Budget: Record failure
    Runtime->>Reconcile: Query status by tool + idempotency key
    Reconcile-->>Runtime: Committed artifact found
    Runtime->>Checkpoint: Persist reconciled observation and ledger
    Runtime->>Agent: Continue from validated state
    Note over Runtime,Agent: No blind write retry occurred
